<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:30:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</link><description>第二财政部长阿米尔·哈姆扎·阿齐赞表示，如果亚洲航空集团有限公司的财务困难恶化，马来西亚可能会考虑介入支持该公司，因为政府寻求保护国内航空连通性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen'&gt;马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Malaysia Says May Intervene If AirAsia’s Struggles Worsen&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:22:52 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:05:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</link><description>中国国务院在罕见的午间会议上重申了对资本市场的支持，强调了所谓国家队的作用，并承诺推出更多稳定股市的政策。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release'&gt;中国内阁在罕见的午间声明中强调市场支持&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：China Stocks Rally After Rare Midday Statement on Market Support&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/china-s-cabinet-stresses-market-support-in-midday-release</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:00:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Mahanadi Coalfields 首次公开募股 9.69 亿美元后将在孟买首次亮相</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mahanadi-coalfields-set-for-mumbai-debut-after-969-million-ipo</link><description>国有煤炭印度有限公司旗下的 Mahanadi Coalfields Ltd. 将于周五在首次公开募股后开始交易，这是自印度市场监管机构禁止公布 IPO 股票所谓的灰市价格以来的首次上市。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mahanadi-coalfields-set-for-mumbai-debut-after-969-million-ipo'&gt;Mahanadi Coalfields 首次公开募股 9.69 亿美元后将在孟买首次亮相&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Mahanadi Coalfields Shares Flat in Debut After $969 Million IPO&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/mahanadi-coalfields-set-for-mumbai-debut-after-969-million-ipo</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>5000亿美元沙子贸易监管不力引发建筑安全担忧</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/features/2026-sand-mining/</link><description>对价值 5000 亿美元的行业监管和执法不均的调查引发了有关安全、环境和法律的问题。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/features/2026-sand-mining/'&gt;5000亿美元沙子贸易监管不力引发建筑安全担忧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Poor Regulation of $500 Billion Sand Trade Raises Construction Safety Concerns&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/features/2026-sand-mining/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 05:22:20 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>